@api = http://localhost:5000

### 1. Kiem tra API dang chay - 200
GET {{api}}/

### 2. Lay danh sach bai tap - 200
GET {{api}}/api/assignments

### 3. Tao luot nop hop le - 201
# @name createSubmission
POST {{api}}/api/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "assignmentId": 1,
  "studentCode": "dtc245200173",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://github.com/your-username/EduSubmit-dtc245200173"
}

### 4. Tao luot nop khong hop le - 400
POST {{api}}/api/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "assignmentId": 0,
  "studentCode": "",
  "repositoryUrl": ""
}

### 5. Doc lai luot nop vua tao - 200
GET {{api}}/api/submissions/{{createSubmission.response.body.$.id}}

### 6. Doc luot nop khong ton tai - 404
GET {{api}}/api/submissions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
